# The build context is the repository root. Keep secrets, local data and build output out of every image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.log
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
apps/api/storage
apps/api/src/generated
.git

# Yarn's caches and state; the pinned release in .yarn/releases IS needed and stays
.yarn/*
!.yarn/releases
.pnp.*
